OL,3,AInterest rates could rise again across
OL,4,Athe world ` here's why
OL,5,
OL,6,FCiting the Middle East conflict and
OL,7,Fwarning inflation was "set to remain
OL,8,Fwell above" its 2% target for some
OL,9,Ftime, the European Central Bank raised
OL,10,Finterest rates this week to 2.5%.
OL,12,FOther central banks are also
OL,13,Fresponding, with the US and the UK
OL,14,Fpoised to make interest-rate decisions
OL,15,Fnext week.
